# Generated at build from the source documents; committing PDFs would let
# them drift from the page. app/accents.css is generated too, but it is
# committed so a fresh clone runs with any package manager; the build
# regenerates it from content/accents.json every time.
public/pdf/*.pdf

# Sprint retrospectives and peer evaluations are private and go to
# Blackboard only. Keep working copies here if you like: nothing in this
# folder can be committed, and the validator refuses a build that mentions
# its sentinel.
content/private/
